# Keep the Firefox source archive to what actually builds the extension.
#
# addons.mozilla.org requires a source upload because the shipped bundle is
# minified, and a reviewer rebuilds from it to compare. Screenshots and demo
# recordings are store assets, not build inputs — 8 MB of them only slows the
# reviewer down. `git archive` honours export-ignore; a normal clone does not.
screenshots/ export-ignore
demo/         export-ignore
